# Cloudflare redirects.
#
# ---- history, because this file has been wrong twice ----
#
# First it rewrote /champions -> /champions.html and friends, to get
# extensionless URLs. Cloudflare already does that itself, so the rules
# made an infinite redirect and every nav tab died.
#
# Then it had:
#     /masteries      /create   301
#     /masteries.html /create   301
# and art/masteries/ was the one folder whose images would not load, while
# art/runes/ beside it was fine. A bare path in this file is supposed to
# match exactly, so /masteries should never have touched
# /art/masteries/512_on.png — but that folder was the only thing in the
# entire configuration named "masteries", and it was the only folder
# failing. Removing the rules costs nothing to find out: masteries.html
# carries its own meta refresh to the creator, so bookmarks still work
# without any rule here at all.
#
# The pattern across both mistakes is the same. Every rule in this file has
# been either useless or actively harmful, and the platform's defaults were
# right on their own. An empty file is the correct amount of configuration
# for a static site on Cloudflare.
